    "language": "English",
    "original_prompt": "The Guild dispatches Kaelen Voss to the Master’s Workshop after the inventor vanishes. The prototype, a device of immense potential, lies dormant—its power core empty and its communication array shattered. Kaelen must scavenge the workstations for parts, decipher the Master’s cryptic notes, outwit rogue automata, and piece together the final invention before the Guild’s deadline. Along the way, he uncovers hints of a deeper secret: the Master may not have left willingly.",
    "image_url": "assets/23676590-e88e-4e70-a42b-8adcf2d79957_cover_a0f037bb.jpg",
    "rule_enforcement_mode": "rpg",
    "time_per_turn": 5,
