      "inventory": [],
      "hp_change": 0,
      "stamina_change": 0,
      "mana_change": 0,
      "text_log_content": "Kaelen—if the Guild sent anyone who could solve my lock, I prayed it would be you.\n\nI did not vanish by accident. The High Council intends to turn my Aetheric Harmonizer into a siege engine. I stripped the core and staged the lockdown to buy time to escape beyond their reach.\n\nFlip the Chamber Control Switch in this office to SAFE before entering the vault—it will bleed the Aegis-IV drone's shields. Once you calibrate the prototype, transmit the telemetry so the Guild leaves me in peace.",
      "text_log_format": "BOOK",
      "on_read_script": "tw.vars.set('read_master_secret', True)",
      "on_read_text": "You uncover the truth behind Master Corvus's staged disappearance and learn the purpose of the Chamber Control Switch."
    },
